| `Subscriptions.channel_id`     | → | `Channels.channel_id`       |
| `Comments.user_id`             | → | `Users.user_id`             |
| `Comments.video_id`            | → | `Videos.video_id`           |
| `Comment_Likes.comment_id`     | → | `Comments.comment_id`       |
| `Comment_Likes.user_id`        | → | `Users.user_id`             |
| `Video_Likes.video_id`         | → | `Videos.video_id`           |
| `Video_Likes.user_id`          | → | `Users.user_id`             |
| `Views.video_id`               | → | `Videos.video_id`           |
