| `Reports.user_id`              | → | `Users.user_id`             |
| `Reports.video_id`             | → | `Videos.video_id`           |
| `Live_Streams.channel_id`      | → | `Channels.channel_id`       |
| `Memberships.user_id`          | → | `Users.user_id`             |
